From 71886fef5be41f4f5b882c9fbab3ba12df17fccd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel King <dan@spiraldb.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:06:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Filter Vortex layout batches before limiting Arrow
 output

Keep Vortex input batches aligned with the file layout and slice adapted output to the requested Arrow batch limit. Preserve projected view types, row positions, lineage, deletes, and zero-column batches. The five-query SF10 screen improved the mean-based rate by 1.42x in paired run orders.
